  "HANDOFF",
  "IN",
  "Machine key ALONE \u2014 no human gate here",
  "OPEN on this stage \u2014 the delegation half of the machinery that serves this function has never fired:\nthe score-writing call and sized builders exist as one disk-write trial (9:1 compression, tags assigned\ncorrectly), not as a session that built something. The first real delegated build is the test of\neverything on this page.",
  "RED \u2014 cost, or a route that leaves the stage / blocks it",
  "Read before writing the order",
  "SIZE +\nASSIGN",
  "THE ORDER",
  "TWO-TIER ACCESS, BY ROLE. the tier is the requirement \u2014\nnot a token-saving trick. a builder holding the whole\nfile re-derives intent from it; a builder holding one\nself-contained piece builds that piece.",
  "The GO'd design package \u2014 INTACT",
  "Tony, 2026-08-03: 'i dont\nneed to approve contract\nif we can measure it meets\noutput of other stages.'",
  "Write the contract \u00b7 Size and assign \u2014 stage flow",
  "Written so a stranger can build it",
  "a BUILDER\nexact spec + related\nmaterials \u2014 AND NO MORE",
  "a tag assigned during planning measures how hard the piece FELT to\nplan, not what judgment survived being written down. write the piece\nin full, then read it and ask what decision is still left in it.",
  "design's GO already\nhappened. this rung never\nre-derives or re-approves\nthe design.",
  "every piece is MEASURABLE against an upstream declaration: the design\npackage, the measurements, the countermeasures. provided that\nmeasuring is real, the human reads nothing at this rung.\na piece NOTHING upstream declared cannot be measured, so it cannot\npass by assertion \u2014 it is a PUSH-BACK to design.",
  "full specs, documents, diagrams, measurements, plans, UX design,\nsystems. nothing summarized on the way in: the contract is written\nFROM upstream truth, not from a digest of it.\nthe qualified risks ride with it \u2014 a countermeasure is a constraint\nthe work order must build around.",
  "implementable by a builder who NEVER SAW THE REASONING. every piece\ncarries its exact scope, the why behind any non-obvious choice, and\nITS OWN CHECK \u2014 a piece without a check cannot be handed to anyone.",
  "pieces flow to builders under the two-tier rule. the ESCALATION\nCONTRACT governs everything downstream: the human hears ONLY of a\ngap no agent role can answer that is a BLOCKER \u2014 the blocker-\nacceptance path from Test viability. otherwise the next report is\nGOAL ACHIEVED.",
  "same grounding law as\ndesign: inputs arrive on\ntheir own, grounding is\nwhat gets skipped.",
  "stricter than today: score corrections\nare currently surfaced to the human\nbefore being made. under this rule they\nare not \u2014 only role-unanswerable\nblockers reach him.",
  "the DONE-assembled rule applied to the\ncontract itself. this REMOVES today's\nper-spec human approval when the\nmachine key holds.",
  "the OVERSEER\nholds ALL upstream truth",
  "the TERRAIN the work will change \u2014 actual code, read not summarized.\nthe order must name exact paths, signatures and values, and it\ncannot do that from memory.\nWHAT WE RULED OUT \u2014 a contract proposes implementation choices.\nSTANDING DECISIONS \u2014 the conventions a work order cannot violate.",
  "the next rung runs its\nOWN entry gate against\nwhat arrived here.",
  "the why travels IN the\npiece. a builder who\nre-derives intent drifts,\nconfidently.",
  "what stays with the\noverseer after honest\ntagging is small \u2014\nand that is correct.",
  "\u2192 Execute a unit  (BUILD)"
 ]
